### Create a ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieName": "Interstellar",
  "customerName": "Abhiram",
  "seatNumber": "A10",
  "ticketPrice": 250.00,
  "screeningId": "INT-2026-001"
}

### List all tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### Get ticket by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1

### Search by movie name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/movie/Interstellar

### Replace ticket details (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieName": "Interstellar",
  "customerName": "Abhiram S",
  "seatNumber": "A11",
  "ticketPrice": 275.00,
  "screeningId": "INT-2026-001"
}

### Update selected fields (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Abhiram S"
}

### Check seat availability
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/availability?screeningId=INT-2026-001&seatNumber=A10

### Cancel ticket (soft cancellation; releases seat)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1

### Invalid sample: blank movie name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieName": " ",
  "customerName": "Abhiram",
  "seatNumber": "A10",
  "ticketPrice": 250.00,
  "screeningId": "INT-2026-001"
}

### Invalid sample: non-positive price (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieName": "Interstellar",
  "customerName": "Abhiram",
  "seatNumber": "A10",
  "ticketPrice": 0,
  "screeningId": "INT-2026-002"
}
